1. Heat the food in the microwave:
   ```
   (:goal (and (heated food)))
   ```

2. Move the heated food to the living room desk:
   ```
   (:goal (and (item_at food livingroom)))
   ```
   ```
   (:goal (and (item_on food desk)))
   ```

3. Move the water bottle to the living room desk:
   ```
   (:goal (and (item_at water_bottle livingroom)))
   ```
   ```
   (:goal (and (item_on water_bottle desk)))
   ```

4. Store the eggs in the egg container:
   ```
   (:goal (and (item_stored eggs egg_container)))
   ```